                <l xml:id="m-e16c427d-ffa6-4796-81e6-1ae7dddda057" facs="#m-2722e66a-3532-4c75-9598-93bf74d1994e" label="ambiguous">Monday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-2e16a7c9-efe2-43ac-b766-634edd14648a" facs="#m-9388de04-a87f-4fd6-abdc-0e568a0071c7" label="ambiguous">co7</l><l xml:id="m-83e0fd2d-e23c-4615-bfce-19f1424374fb" facs="#m-6705aee5-b4ef-43c5-8e16-ce8a3c0cfca4" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus Deus auxiliátor meus,</l><l xml:id="m-43edecf8-6a54-4300-881a-4e7b87dd4639" facs="#m-c78b54ff-3751-48af-9b5f-a062cd11c2c4" label="lyrics-like">liátor meus: quis est qui con¬</l><l xml:id="m-604eeca2-f0a4-4f3a-837c-9065ccff3c8c" facs="#m-e4ca394c-d1b0-40d9-9ce9-a97b256b5cf2" label="lyrics-like">ideo non sum confúsus: ideo</l><l xml:id="m-90177f65-e2bb-4c65-9702-9f6bfdbe5d9b" facs="#m-d18e9e08-3d54-48a4-b251-1fd212f7ae1d" label="lyrics-like">démnet me? Ecce omnes quasi</l><l xml:id="m-c0acdb3f-14bb-4cfe-91bd-6e29c1add14a" facs="#m-8733faa8-059a-4ee1-8a42-e69c002b4d2f" label="lyrics-like">pósui fáciem meam ut petram</l><l xml:id="m-4d64b0c5-8cc3-405a-aec4-4151dc46d075" facs="#m-e6f587c4-ec01-4283-a17d-7beba37a9cff" label="lyrics-like">vestiméntum conteréntur, tinea</l><l xml:id="m-a5f13184-36a9-4295-be3a-6efa49a23395" facs="#m-b0621264-d3a0-4390-bb7c-2a22fa46188b" label="lyrics-like">duríssimam, et scio, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-45c54cfb-3faa-4636-ad6e-08dc685a249d" facs="#m-81297c9a-55d3-42cf-92f1-906724bab165" label="lyrics-like">cómedet eos. Quis ex vobis ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-59af393d-59ee-4b33-898c-114b3d2afe71" facs="#m-aacd4be9-e2f6-45db-bb2e-d5f97c9a09e2" label="lyrics-like">non confúndar. Juxta est, qui</l><l xml:id="m-4e8d911b-32a3-4ad7-8413-4d138f898cab" facs="#m-b887dab2-6fd3-4d74-beaa-73be6bd3a807" label="lyrics-like">mens Dóminum, áudiens vocem</l><l xml:id="m-cf2f8e88-8540-4f49-99cd-2bcd51912ada" facs="#m-58e1ad5f-1188-48eb-8295-1d10908885eb" label="ambiguous">justincat me, quis contradicet</l><l xml:id="m-8f13b51d-70a1-4b3e-aac1-8a9516155db7" facs="#m-86e009aa-8916-47d4-b68e-061bc996f17c" label="lyrics-like">servi sui? Qui ambulávit in</l><l xml:id="m-830c13bd-bb07-478a-aa4f-4a3881082389" facs="#m-1056aeb3-038e-488d-b4b0-c22eb6efa573" label="ambiguous">mihi? Stemus simul, quis est</l><l xml:id="m-e5c95936-112e-46fd-a572-ab665b4029ba" facs="#m-dbf8cbdf-509f-4226-9aca-604fd8187634" label="lyrics-like">ténebris, et non est lumen ei,</l><l xml:id="m-669c7377-5287-4c14-841b-97fe1d9fc6f8" facs="#m-1555106b-985a-4553-8ee6-849162802c88" label="lyrics-like">adversárius meus? Accédat ad</l><l xml:id="m-b24bed5b-2509-4d97-9233-69e74b7fd775" facs="#m-5c7c8df2-bdce-434a-82e7-3c9a06a39f89" label="lyrics-like">speret in nómine Dómini, et</l><l xml:id="m-97ab1071-2487-4984-a816-2e9ba70adbf4" facs="#m-7bec9a36-60d0-42f2-b336-1433f41cb1a2" label="lyrics-like">me. Ecce Dóminus Deus auxi-linnitátur super Deum suum.</l><l xml:id="m-1c567eb2-3782-42ee-b791-813e05b6f057" facs="#m-581e3a8b-661b-44a2-920b-4890b58a5d38" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-c60e1902-6e2b-4542-9c45-57df7f5331af" facs="#m-9d415c8c-9c97-4cf4-aa37-869d1a7b5977" label="ambiguous">3</l><l xml:id="m-0f0e1376-bed9-4500-8e2d-ddf957375125" facs="#m-adae02f7-d727-44a5-8b1d-5e83d74fffe7" label="lyrics-like">Xsúrge,“ Dómi-ne,</l><l xml:id="m-3e3ae1af-7130-4483-a50a-795bae53d82b" facs="#m-15af8263-a886-47e3-a75f-76141a0d4e76" label="lyrics-like">et intén¬</l><l xml:id="m-288bf6c0-5fe5-48bb-8d37-1e49c4bbaf8b" facs="#m-a745dddc-c2a6-443a-9daf-d48eb1985864" label="lyrics-like">de judí-ci¬ um mé¬ um,</l><l xml:id="m-52065b01-cb19-4a0f-a44f-ae9329259d9d" facs="#m-bc91bd6c-f597-4aab-aa66-75edc95f6eb7" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-91d92353-6654-4c42-9a98-b2acfb9b5713" facs="#m-55f331c8-99c5-4451-8ab7-6bd9a729cce8" label="ambiguous">us,</l><l xml:id="m-0e841cce-efef-47eb-b3ed-51d406c05ac7" facs="#m-840e586a-d259-4f5b-ba41-6cd40fdf32f7" label="lyrics-like">et Dómi-nus mé¬ us,</l><l xml:id="m-a5bf0b9e-ecaf-4c18-afde-0996a3d4c334" facs="#m-924bc360-b883-45c1-bc42-8e7ff6dacd52" label="lyrics-like">in cáusam mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b61ef9b7-9fa6-4e17-beb7-de354d9a5e08" facs="#m-b208dec5-b0ed-4055-b0e1-6c04d2d7e3bd" label="lyrics-like">V. Effúnde fráme-am,</l><l xml:id="m-cb883290-19a3-4205-8149-509ebd0c4a46" facs="#m-01ec1da3-c609-4bbf-93fb-e1dae93f2deb" label="ambiguous">am.</l><l xml:id="m-df9877a1-0aa0-4207-9bd5-b1d8dbd21460" facs="#m-c4f6f538-3a1a-459a-875a-20d72c04cc35" label="lyrics-like">et conclú¬</l><l xml:id="m-195113d6-bbcd-4272-9630-95615b9b3f64" facs="#m-f3c6b974-34f6-4956-affa-fb8b74f90ecc" label="ambiguous">de</l><l xml:id="m-92a84319-f617-4fe5-981b-c9828291940e" facs="#m-4810f0ee-551c-4bd0-8786-be6ce3522211" label="lyrics-like">advér¬</l><l xml:id="m-754f4d7e-7f6b-4403-be7b-8602f9388ff3" facs="#m-b4fe5245-2dae-4130-89f8-2c549438e8c5" label="ambiguous">os</l><l xml:id="m-9e51a37f-a793-409a-9c61-cf632f4696a2" facs="#m-43cbdfd7-9df8-4b84-a659-423616c10b16" label="ambiguous">sus e¬</l><l xml:id="m-caf581d5-b0f2-408a-966e-5534e1fa531f" facs="#m-36f7708d-0f5f-4b7f-b4b6-68c049e959ed" label="ambiguous">qui me</l><l xml:id="m-aee6f866-8c49-4209-95f4-24752423cdb8" facs="#m-7aa64efe-8d13-4f69-b5aa-053f9f1ce981" label="lyrics-like">persequúntur.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
